"pro.free":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Picking activities, timers, saved data, widgets, import and standard sharing stay free. No subscription or automatic charge."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活动抽取、计时、已有数据、小组件、导入和标准分享都可免费使用。无订阅，不自动扣款。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"挑選活動、計時、現有資料、小工具、匯入與標準分享皆可免費使用。無訂閱，不自動扣款。"}}}},
